            appearance: Some("Ethylhexyl acetate appears as a water-white liquid. Insoluble in water and is less dense than water. Flash point 180 °F. Used as a solvent and in perfumes. Liquid or vapors may irritate skin and eyes. Vapors have a fruity, pleasant odor."),
