            properties: [],
            description: Some("Propanethiol is an organic compound with the molecular formula C3H8S. It belongs to the group of thiols. It is a colorless liquid with a strong, offensive odor. It is moderately toxic and is less dense than water and slightly soluble in water. It is used as a feedstock for insecticides. It is  highly flammable and it gives off irritating or toxic fumes (or gases) in a fire. Heating it will cause rise in pressure with risk of bursting."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
            hazard_summary: Some("H225 (100%): Highly Flammable liquid and vapor [Danger Flammable liquids]"),
            uses: ["Fuels and fuel additives", "Intermediate", "All Other Basic Organic Chemical Manufacturing", "Chemical intermediate; herbicide", "Intermediates", "Odor agents"],
            logp: None,
            appearance: Some("Propyl mercaptan appears as a colorless liquid with a strong, offensive odor. Moderately toxic. Flash point below 0 °F. Less dense than water and slightly soluble in water. Hence floats on water. Used as a chemical intermediate and a herbicide."),
