            properties: [],
            description: Some("Ethylene glycol (IUPAC name: ethane-1,2-diol) is an organic compound (a vicinal diol) with the formula (CH2OH)2. It is mainly used for two purposes: as a raw material in the manufacture of polyester fibers and for antifreeze formulations. It is an odorless, colorless, flammable, viscous liquid. It has a sweet taste but is toxic in high concentrations. This molecule has been observed in outer space."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
            hazard_summary: Some("H370: Causes damage to organs [Danger Specific target organ toxicity, single exposure]"),
