            properties: [],
            description: Some("Hexamethyldisiloxane (HMDSO or MM) is an organosilicon compound with the formula O[Si(CH3)3]2.  This volatile colourless liquid is used as a solvent and as a reagent in organic synthesis.  It is prepared by the hydrolysis of trimethylsilyl chloride.  The molecule is the protypical disiloxane and resembles a subunit of polydimethylsiloxane."),
