            properties: [],
            description: Some("2-Methylundecanal is an organic compound that is found naturally in kumquat peel oil. This compound smells herbaceous, orange, and ambergris-like. At high dilution it has a flavor similar to honey and nuts. It is a colorless or pale yellow liquid that is soluble in organic solvents such as ether and ethanol. It is used as a fragrance component in soaps, detergents, and perfumes."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
            hazard_summary: Some("H315 (> 99.9%): Causes skin irritation [Warning Skin corrosion/irritation]"),
