            properties: [],
            description: Some("Dibenzoylmethane (DBM) is an organic compound with the formula (C6H5C(O))2CH2.  DBM is the name for a 1,3-diketone, but the compound exists primarily as one of two equivalent enol tautomers.  DBM is a white solid. Due UV-absorbing properties, derivatives of DBM such as avobenzone, have found applications as sunscreen products."),
