            synonyms: ["Ehytl Vanillin", "Ethyl vanillin", "Ethylvanillin glucoside", "4-hydroxy-3-ethoxybenzaldehyde", "3-ethoxy-4-[3,4,5-trihydroxy-6-(hydroxymethyl)o…", "3-Ethoxy-4-hydroxybenzaldehyde", "121-32-4", "Bourbonal"],
