            description: Some("Sulfanilic acid (4-aminobenzenesulfonic acid) is an organic compound with the formula H3NC6H4SO3. It is an off-white solid. It is a zwitterion, which explains its high melting point compared to the related compounds aniline and benzenesulfonic acid.  It is a common building block in organic chemistry."),
