            appearance: Some("N,n-dimethylaniline appears as a yellow to brown colored oily liquid with a fishlike odor. Less dense than water and insoluble in water. Flash point 150 °F. Toxic by ingestion, inhalation, and skin absorption. Used to make dyes and as a solvent."),
