            description: Some("4-Anisaldehyde, or p-Anisaldehyde, is an organic compound with the formula CH3OC6H4CHO.  The molecule consists of a benzene ring with a formyl and a methoxy group.  It is a colorless liquid with a strong aroma. It provides sweet, floral and strong aniseed odor.  Two isomers of 4-anisaldehyde are known, ortho-anisaldehyde and meta-anisaldehyde.  They are less commonly encountered."),
