            description: Some("Zinc borate refers to a family of inorganic compounds consisting of borate of zinc. They are white solids with the formulas:

ZnO·B2O3·1.12H2O
ZnO·B2O3·~ 2H2O
ZnO·5B2O3·4.5H2O
2ZnO·3B2O3·3H2O
2ZnO·3B2O3·7H2O
