            logp: Some(2.13),
            appearance: Some("Hexyl acetate appears as a colorless liquid with a mild sweet odor. Flash point 113 °F. A moderate fire risk. Inhalation may cause adverse effects. Insoluble in water and very soluble in alcohols and ethers. When heated to high temperatures emits acrid smoke and fumes. Used as a solvent and as a propellant in aerosols."),
