            properties: [IsBase],
            description: Some("Almotriptan, sold under the brand names Axert and Almogran among others, is a triptan medication used in the treatment of heavy migraine headache.
Almotriptan was patented in 1992 and approved for medical use in 2000. It was discovered and developed by Almirall-Prodesfarma."),
