            description: Some("Ethylidene norbornene (ENB) is an organic compound that consists of an ethylidene (CH3C(H)=) group attached to norbornene.  It is a colorless liquid.  The molecule consists of two sites of unsaturation. The compound consists of (E)- and (Z)-stereoisomers, but the mixtures are typically not separated."),
