            properties: [IsAcid],
            description: Some("Tetrahydro-2-furoic acid is an organic compound with the formula HO2CC4H7O.  It is a colorless oil. Tetrahydro-2-furoic acid is a useful pharmaceutical intermediate relevant to the production of several drugs, including Terazosin for the treatment of prostate enlargement and hypertension.  or high boiling liquid,"),
