            decay_particle_id: None,
            properties: [IsBase],
            description: Some("Pomalidomide, sold under the brand names Pomalyst and Imnovid, is an anti-cancer medication used for the treatment of multiple myeloma and AIDS-related Kaposi sarcoma.
Pomalidomide was approved for medical use in the United States in February 2013, and in the European Union in August 2013. It is available as a generic medication."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
            hazard_summary: None,
