            properties: [],
            description: Some("2-Ethylhexyl glycidyl ether is a liquid organic molecule with formula C11H22O2 an industrial chemical used to reduce the viscosity of epoxy resins. These are then used in adhesives, sealants, and paints or coatings. It has the CAS Registry Number of 2461-15-6. It has the IUPAC name of 2-(2-ethylhexoxymethyl)oxirane. It also finds use in other polymer based applications."),
