            logp: Some(4.491),
            appearance: Some("Diphenyl chlorophosphate appears as a clear colorless to light yellow liquid with a pungent odor. Insoluble in water and denser than water. Hence sinks in water. Contact may severely irritate skin, eyes and mucous membranes."),
