            description: Some("3,5-Dimethylpiperidines are chemical compounds with the formula C5H8(CH3)2NH.  Two diastereomers exist: the achiral R,S isomer and the chiral R,R/S,S enantiomeric pair. 3,5-Dimethylpiperidine is a precursor to tibric acid.
