            decay_particle_id: None,
            properties: [IsBase],
            description: Some("2,2′-Bipyridine (bipy or bpy, pronounced ) is an organic compound with the formula (C5H4N)2. This colorless solid is an important isomer of the bipyridine family. It is a bidentate chelating ligand, forming complexes with many transition metals. Ruthenium and platinum complexes of bipy exhibit intense luminescence."),
