            properties: [],
            description: Some("Propadiene () or allene () is the organic compound with the formula H2C=C=CH2.  It is the simplest allene, i.e. a compound with two adjacent carbon double bonds. As a constituent of MAPP gas, it has been used as a fuel for specialized welding."),
