            properties: [],
            description: Some("1,3-pentadiene appears as a clear colorless liquid with an acrid odor. A dangerous fire risk. Vapors are irritating to the eyes and respiratory system. Subject to polymerization if heated or contaminated. If the polymerization takes place inside a container, the container may violently rupture. Insoluble in water. Used to make intermediates and polymers."),
