            properties: [IsAcid, IsBase],
            description: Some("Ammonium acetate, also known as spirit of Mindererus in aqueous solution, is a chemical compound with the formula NH4CH3CO2. It is a white, hygroscopic solid and can be derived from the reaction of ammonia and acetic acid. It is available commercially."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
            hazard_summary: None,
