            description: Some("Sodium p-toluenesulfonate is an organic compound with the formula CH3C6H4SO3Na.  It is white, water-soluble solid.  It is produced by the neutralization toluenesulfonic acid with sodium hydroxide.  It is also a common product from the reactions of sodium-based reagents with toluenesulfonates.
Heating this salt in strong base results in desulfonation, giving, after acid workup, p-cresol."),
