            properties: [],
            description: Some("Diketene is an organic compound with the molecular formula C4H4O2, and which is sometimes written as (CH2CO)2.  It is formed by dimerization of ketene, H2C=C=O. Diketene is a member of the oxetane family. It is used as a reagent in organic chemistry. It is a colorless liquid."),
