            hazard_summary: Some("H318 (70.4%): Causes serious eye damage [Danger Serious eye damage/eye irritation]"),
            uses: ["All Other Basic Organic Chemical Manufacturing", "Intermediate", "Reagent in synthetic organic chemistry."],
            logp: Some(0.447),
            appearance: Some("Diketene, stabilized appears as a colorless liquid with a disagreeable odor. Slightly less dense than water. Irritates skin and eyes. Used to make paints and pharmaceuticals."),
