            decay_particle_id: None,
            properties: [IsAcid, IsBase],
            description: Some("Ammonium persulfate (APS) is the inorganic compound with the formula (NH4)2S2O8. It is a colourless (white) salt that is highly soluble in water, much more so than the related potassium salt. It is a strong oxidizing agent that is used as a catalyst in polymer chemistry, as an etchant, and as a cleaning and bleaching agent."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
