            appearance: Some("Isophorone appears as a clear colorless liquid, with a camphor-like odor. Less dense than water and insoluble in water. Boiling point 420 °F. Flash point near 200 °F. Contact irritates skin and eyes. Toxic by ingestion. Used as a solvent and in pesticides."),
