            description: Some("Intravenous iron sucrose, sold under the brand name Venofer is a treatment used for iron deficiency anemia. Iron sucrose replaces iron in the blood to foster red blood cell production in patients with chronic kidney disease.
Iron sucrose is available as a generic medication."),
            text_source: Some("Wikipedia"),
