            properties: [IsAcid],
            description: Some("Calcium lactate is a white crystalline salt with formula C6H10CaO6, consisting of two lactate anions H3C(CHOH)CO−2 for each calcium cation Ca2+.  It forms several hydrates, the most common being the pentahydrate C6H10CaO6·5H2O.
