            properties: [],
            description: Some("Potassium tert-butoxide       (or potassium t-butoxide) is a chemical compound with the formula [(CH3)3COK]n (abbr. KOtBu). This colourless solid is a strong base (pKa of conjugate acid is 17 in H2O), which is useful in organic synthesis.  The compound is often depicted as a salt, and it often behaves as such, but its ionization depends on the solvent."),
