            description: Some("N-(n-Butyl)thiophosphoric triamide (NBPT) is the organophosphorus compound with the formula SP(NH2)2(NHC4H9). It is an amide of thiophosphoric acid. A white solid, NBPT is an \"enhanced efficiency fertilizer\", intended to limit the release of nitrogen-containing gases following fertilization. Regarding its chemical structure, the molecule features tetrahedral phosphorus bonded to sulfur and three amido groups."),
